Third-party code and weights (not covered by the license above):

- continuitycam/models/softsplat.py: softmax splatting by Simon Niklaus and Feng Liu,
  https://github.com/sniklaus/softmax-splatting. Its authors state that the implementation is
  strictly for academic purposes only; contact them for commercial use.
